The discussion regarding the validity of "avoiding a fare on public transport" led me to realize its complexity. Initially inclined to view it negatively, thinking avoidance equates to cheating, my mind began shifting as nuanced perspectives emerged.

@67ed90 let’s continue exploring whether choosing to avoid transporting payments, particularly in delicate circumstances, constitutes justifiable action or reckless disregard for societal rules.

Your turn!
